---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="写文">
  <section class="page-heading">
    <div class="eyebrow">YOUR WORDS, YOUR SPACE</div>
    <h1>
      写下<span>这一刻。</span>
    </h1>
    <p>只有站主可以保存、编辑和发布。</p>
    <a href="/admin/posts/">管理文章 →</a>· <a href="/admin/media/">视频转码</a>
  </section>
  <section class="editor-panel">
    <p id="editor-status" role="status">
      正在验证站主身份…
    </p>
    <form id="editor-form">
      <fieldset disabled>
        <label>
          类型
          <select name="kind">
            <option value="note">动态</option>
            <option value="article">文章</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label>
          标题
          <input name="title" maxlength="120" />
        </label>
        <label>
          正文（Markdown）
          <textarea name="body" rows="16" maxlength="20000" required></textarea>
        </label>
        <label>
          摘要<textarea name="excerpt" rows="2" maxlength="300"></textarea>
        </label>
        <label>
          标签（逗号分隔，最多 8 个）
          <input name="tags" />
        </label>
        <label>
          手动地点
          <input name="location" maxlength="80" />
        </label>
        <label class="editor-check">
          <input name="pinned" type="checkbox" />
          置顶
        </label>
        <div class="editor-actions">
          <button type="submit">保存</button>
          <button type="button" id="editor-preview">
            预览
          </button>
          <button type="button" id="editor-publish" disabled>
            发布
          </button>
          <button type="button" id="editor-withdraw" hidden>
            撤回为草稿
          </button>
          <button type="button" id="editor-archive" hidden>
            归档
          </button>
          <a id="editor-live-link" hidden target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            查看原文 ↗
          </a>
        </div>
        <p>
          新内容先保存草稿；已发布内容保存后会立即更新。正文媒体上传暂未接通，不会把本地文件预览当作已上传。
        </p>
      </fieldset>
    </form>
    <section
      id="editor-preview-panel"
      class="post-body"
      aria-label="正文预览"
      hidden
    ></section>
  </section>
  <script>
    import '../../lib/editor-client';
  </script>
</Base>
